{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1116692-do-we-know-when-2e-is-coming-out","id":1116692,"title":"Do we know when 2e is coming out?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-15T21:03:17-07:00","id":1116692,"title":"Do we know when 2e is coming out?","content":"Sorry if this is redundant. I've been out of the loop for a few months, but I'm looking to start a new game (set in 80s Miami, a bit homebrewed to accommodate a slightly more comic<br /> setting), and I'm trying to decide if I should tweak the original core to match the 2e rules (which I love), or just hold off until the new book comes out.<br /> <br /> So... any word on the release window?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T23:02:10-07:00","id":1116739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dxanders</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1116692-do-we-know-when-2e-is-coming-out#post1116692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... any word on the release window?</div> </div> </div> </div>There is nothing definitive. But as we only had literally 3 very early previews of 2E ( <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/corebook-outline-kick-off-hunter-the-vigil/\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>, <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/hunter-2e-open-dev-tier-two-compacts-and-globalization/\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> and <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/hunter-2e-open-dev-slashers-and-ashwood-abbey/\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> - with a very big dosage 'everything in those can change' ) and <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/always-darkest-before-the-era-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">last Monday Meeting Notes</a> point HtV 2E corebook as in first Redlines - I will be <b>shocked</b> if we see book <i><u>before</u></i> <i>end of 2018</i>. It's all my guessing ( as always with RPG books ), but based on observation of previous 2E corebooks production process. Hunter 2E is moving - it's just only on 1/4 of writing process, more or less.<br /> <br /> I think you should run '1.5E' game and just be ready to switch rules IF game actually comes out. We are 1,5 year before premier ( I think ) so you may as well end game even before it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-16-2017, 02:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T03:18:00-07:00","id":1116771,"title":"","content":"My guess is 2019-2021. Changeling will have a Kickstarter later this year and might come out either late 2017 or sometime during 2018. Then I think it's time for Geist which I believe will take at least a year after Changeling. Once Geist is out I predict at least another year before Hunter.<br /> <br /> Edit: I forgot about Deviant. I'm not sure when Deviant is supposed to get released, but probably before Hunter seeing how long it's been in development. That could be another year before Hunter gets released.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T04:08:45-07:00","id":1116790,"title":"","content":"Short answer: We don't know yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T04:55:48-07:00","id":1116800,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11887_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11887\" data-vbnamecard=\"11887\">Tessie</a>, we can have more than one game 2E corebook in one year. It's <i>exactly </i>what happened in 2015 ( Werewolf and Beast ) and 2016 ( Mage and Promethean ). So 2E Changeling coming in 2018 does not preclude Geist or Hunter in the same year. Hunter will be probably much later because it is in early writing, for now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-16-2017, 09:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T05:56:05-07:00","id":1116817,"title":"","content":"My guess is next year after Geist. Last I heard, a week or two ago, Deviant wasn't approved to have an official outline yet. I think Mortal Remains has suggestions on updating Hunter. I think you will have to do with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T10:01:33-07:00","id":1116876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1116692-do-we-know-when-2e-is-coming-out?p=1116771#post1116771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My guess is 2019-2021. Changeling will have a Kickstarter later this year and might come out either late 2017 or sometime during 2018. Then I think it's time for Geist which I believe will take at least a year after Changeling. Once Geist is out I predict at least another year before Hunter.<br /> <br /> Edit: I forgot about Deviant. I'm not sure when Deviant is supposed to get released, but probably before Hunter seeing how long it's been in development. That could be another year before Hunter gets released.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hah, Geist coming out before Vigil. Tell me another one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T10:35:51-07:00","id":1116894,"title":"","content":"Wow. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Okay, yeah. I'd thought it was further along with that. 1.5 it is! Thanks, guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T12:41:45-07:00","id":1116946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1116692-do-we-know-when-2e-is-coming-out?p=1116876#post1116876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hah, Geist coming out before Vigil. Tell me another one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well over with cWoD it's looking like CtD20 is coming out before WtO20. So eh. These things happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T16:09:59-07:00","id":1118742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> 